<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-SHEFFIELD SHIELD SCORES.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SHEFFIELD SHIELD SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-12-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Close of play scores in four-day</p>
<p>Sheffield Shield cricket matches on Saturday:</p>
<p>Third day</p>
<p>In Brisbane: New South Wales 190 and 206 for two</p>
<p>(Steve Waugh 69 not out, Mark Waugh 78 not out). Queensland 549</p>
<p>(Stuart Law 144, Jimmy Maher 91, Ian Healy 88, Andrew Bichel 58,</p>
<p>Andrew Symonds 50).</p>
<p>Second day</p>
<p>In Perth: South Australia 258 (James Brayshaw 73, Darren</p>
<p>Lehmann 52). Western Australia 289 for three (Justin Langer</p>
<p>146 not out, Damien Martyn 104).</p>
</text>
